{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53960","headline":"劝学偈 · 景岑","name":"劝学偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万丈竿头未得休，堂堂有路少人游。\n禅师欲（《景德传灯录》作「愿」）达南泉去，满目青山万万秋。\n（《祖堂集》卷十七、《景德传灯录》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}